            "text_position": "place-self-center text-center",
            "icon": "none",
            "icon_width": 48,
            "subheading": "",
            "title": "Customize Your Basket",
            "content": "<p>Sometimes you can't find exactly what you want — so build it yourself. Choose your spirits, mixers, snacks, accessories, and more, and make it extra special with engraving. Every custom basket is made to order by our expert Basket Builders to create a one-of-a-kind gift for the people who matter to you. Perfect for personal celebrations and corporate gifting alike.</p>",
            "link_text": "CUSTOMIZE NOW",
            "link_url": "/apps/gbb/easybundle/1",
            "background": "#f6f1eb",
            "background_gradient": "",
            "text_color": "#000000",
            "text_gradient": "",
            "button_background": "",
            "button_text_color": ""
          }
        },
        "image_ymXX9D": {
          "type": "image",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/30_espresso-martini-kit-gift_hero.png",
            "media_width": 50,
            "media_position": "start",
            "text_position": "place-self-center text-center",
            "icon": "none",
            "icon_width": 48,
            "subheading": "",
            "title": "Most Popular Gift Sets",
            "content": "<p>The best way to celebrate holidays, birthdays, milestones, and everyday wins — for anyone you want to make feel special. Whether it's for business or pleasure, our gift baskets feature tequila, gin, vodka, wine, and champagne, plus alcohol-free options packed with treats. Thoughtfully curated, beautifully packaged, ready to send.</p>",
            "link_text": "SHOP GIFT SETS",
            "link_url": "shopify://collections/shop-all",
            "background": "#f6f1eb",
            "background_gradient": "",
            "text_color": "#000000",
            "text_gradient": "",
