    "promise": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "subheading_xxpAzU": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "text": "Awesome gifting, since 2014"
          }
        },
        "heading_AnJfWd": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "text": "The Bounty Basket Co. Promise",
            "heading_tag": "h1",
            "text_color": "",
            "gradient": ""
          }
        },
        "richtext_7QedhG": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>We’ve been helping people send awesome gifts since 2014. It started with The BroBasket — a simple idea that the people we love deserve a gift that actually feels like them, not another generic box. Tens of thousands of happy customers later, that idea grew bigger than we ever planned.</p><p>The Bounty Basket Co. is where that expertise opens up to everyone. Same obsessive curation, same fast and careful shipping, same in-house team that genuinely cares whether your gift lands — now built for men and women alike, for every occasion worth celebrating.</p><p>Because great gifting was never really about who it’s for. It’s about sending something thoughtful, beautiful, and a little bit fun — the kind of gift that makes someone feel genuinely seen.</p><p>That’s our promise: whoever you’re celebrating — a friend, your mom, your partner, a colleague who came through — we’ll help you send them something awesome. Every single time.</p><p>Cheers, to better gifting for everyone.</p><p><strong>James</strong><br/>Founder, The Bounty Basket Co.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "subheading_xxpAzU",
